<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25494" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπεραίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring to a conclusion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					333
				</span></i>
			; <i>describe thoroughly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				47b
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπέραινέ μοι</span>
			<i>tell</i> me <i>all,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				1056
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὁδόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					625b
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορφῆς διαπεράνασθαι κρίσιν</span>
			<i>to get</i> the trial of beauty <i>decided,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπεράνασθαι λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					263e
				</span></i>
			, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				7.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>traverse, pass through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοβόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					2.8
				</span></i>
			 (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπεράω</span>).</div>
